# GitHub OAuth (Device Flow) — one-time setup
#
# 1. Create an OAuth App: https://github.com/settings/applications/new
#    - Application name: Project Hub
#    - Homepage URL: http://localhost (any URL is fine)
#    - NO callback URL needed for Device Flow
#
# 2. Copy the Client ID and set it here or in Settings → GitHub:
#
# GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=Iv1.your_client_id_here
